Third-party dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Fleet vendors no third-party source. Dependencies are resolved through the Go
module system and carry their own licenses, recorded in each module's go.mod
within go.sum alongside its version. The direct dependencies of the `core`
module as of this commit:

    github.com/pkoukk/tiktoken-go         MIT
    github.com/pkoukk/tiktoken-go-loader  MIT

Add any newly introduced direct dependency to this list in the same commit that
introduces it.
